{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcbdd55f454c8ae09e4be78b81d9abc62da371f3f1cf491c3023fc8f62c7f456",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a58ab09cb8d86b257b5455b1fdd0b6d13419b8e05996b74dd66aa1dccb89013",
      "text": "开会的时间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee9ca60e67a34e52062877614b2efe6141d5cc2365df69b2e4eb783122087a9b",
      "text": "翼原本打算在事务所和制作人开会。\n然而，本应交接照看弟妹的母亲\n因急事无法按时回家。陷入困境的翼\n向制作人提出了某个提议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a58ab09cb8d86b257b5455b1fdd0b6d13419b8e05996b74dd66aa1dccb89013",
      "text": "开会的时间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4badf66e547fe29de38d77a327cce359ae97919e403a849500fb65d9117202a1",
      "text": "柏木家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:754663dc8a589e5078d3751d40abcb973aaab1fd5774a9f1dd98580c4c6962d1",
      "text": "（开会需要的资料\n都在这里了吧。没忘带东西，搞定）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36299a17025c1013b95dcdc87c61176a8db091a875935e0fad525d1cbece4428",
      "text": "你们两个，妈妈马上就回来了，\n再稍微等一会儿哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a",
      "text": "好——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e998ed7900e11284fb8b29ac398977730d8bc2a48135c71bfb27b44ff0f501c9",
      "text": "等妈妈回来我就要去工作了……\n嗯？妈妈打来的电话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c28bebafd566981fd4920797a21b6db560cd9e40b85b98d1b5cbc7b0a3bdfc8",
      "text": "喂？怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d29dbc6a3192561151ada19ef5baea547694ea041639d63b0693521148269e9b",
      "text": "啊，翼？对不起啊，\n事情耽搁了，傍晚前可能回不去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da1c7f3cd6c001b82c5cb78716f99f29884869d6054d82a6ca62f34cb097fc1d",
      "text": "能麻烦你就这样继续看家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f036d5a2ffad0772eeaaff3098ac4390f326e278f04dc46e203283a8915593",
      "text": "哎？我今天有工作上的碰头会啊。\n但是，也不能把他们俩单独丢下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dd5c65a632c570f7cacf3ad974e2d94b47321d075f4eeba12bc8c4314854430",
      "text": "我先跟制作人商量一下吧。\n晚点再打给你，稍微等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a24af93c2a707e93e743055e5056f2e404539b83dde153f235efa32988d8bc13",
      "text": "……事情就是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a406cac20aeba029d555ee76ac4cb02f7c8a5cd21cf61641e58e9e99dab977b9",
      "text": "我了解情况了。\n那今天的碰头会就重新调整时间吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b2c5907467a884736375e63306f668220855df807f457ea74fcd7131b30ca22",
      "text": "关于这件事……如果不介意的话，\n要不要来我家碰头开会呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0990254158e0772b108b49ddaf491a882e1e869f2ef37f59961eec79e4a84877",
      "text": "因为弟弟妹妹在可能会有点吵，\n如果不嫌打扰的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9209d4db3a72b52286988d7a0c9f6da2bffcdc66034d9d204a52ddc2082e50fe",
      "text": "可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:030c8487c950cdda4fc68a2b290fe74f371eb5a3b97de3f2d2096a8ba97ec50f",
      "text": "当然可以。啊，不过，\n要劳烦您特意跑一趟就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb0862a49faf23d92ed5ba8f59ceb5f0e94fd3401eb7e3953efd45efccaff28",
      "text": "哪里哪里，千万别这么说。那我稍后\n就过去拜访，请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e",
      "text": "一小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea43f96b5b1adc34f9e5436b89342eafcfe7819943bae5532734c284ffd0a0cc",
      "text": "欢迎，●●●●プロデューサー。\n请进，快请进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc433a2879712a3a270f100ef42e9adab6bffc6ee3fdeb0d02534fda8b3b44e7",
      "text": "打扰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea140dc024668e5eb1b9516a0cf0000418862d43902413417520d7a882f2238",
      "text": "给您介绍一下。这边是妹妹，这边是弟弟。\n来，打个招呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edfb0c3ca049f35dea58d7681840b2c922023fe73984c73819160e92fda21fc7",
      "text": "初次见面！\n一直承蒙您照顾哥哥了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f6432aca4d86ce4faf0af878c3fbe9c9603be3b3f260fdaa497e41abe0f5d5a",
      "text": "初、初次见面……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabcdf1e0c5164dd45ebbfacc4f072b98004433ada949f42d234e316cb127a4a",
      "text": "初次见面。真是一对可爱的姐弟呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ab341cba5b0ea4b77db46b83fb52bc1d79c8134d1725a921b0b601a9b06d30e",
      "text": "对吧？他们可是我的骄傲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:321c5f9e790bf80e4e02255c7c4ab69b830dd9f9b3c99043901acbaf4251c8d7",
      "text": "年纪还小，把他们两个人留在家里\n总觉得不放心……不好意思，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c96499606be0679bd5cbaf9e36dd4644b9090e6fa92fc9dc5c490d915b434942",
      "text": "那么，请坐这张桌子吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e635de256bd73e8fc7c6676513a2ea2da8ec56361cc9ac4e9d9aae226c2203c",
      "text": "来，这是咖啡。\n牛奶和糖放在这里了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6f41289ab2f191968546529199c63155a79004293f4686dea40e6b7715d914b",
      "text": "谢谢。\n那我开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e2f50b4cbb91dce0f279370582fd2da471985b9bf91331b51bda8eac3b3a15a",
      "text": "嗯……这咖啡，非常美味呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32d84adb54ec76cd8b3d7b9eed4a35270f0f20e87120288abdc04e69c4aa7f39",
      "text": "合您的口味吗？太好了。\n这个我也非常中意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5755cb86646aa2062f0842c7fff080218d3a099fb5521684b1829640320f2fe",
      "text": "之前喝过一次就念念不忘……\n就自己个人进口买回来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6323d7ddb9eb66c62c5ac0b6e168d845dbe327246a33695ddecc72e3fc4f1a0c",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n这么好喝的话，我也能理解这份心情了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03338f82f85b0790e9f8527679aeb3e5276d00babbee97297606032611d0f313",
      "text": "呵呵，谢谢夸奖。\n那么，我们进入碰头会正题吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26476a0bca0025b94246c251a8c210da69ad7e478b75d13bc758325fb2bdb598",
      "text": "好。翼先生接下来的工作是出演舞台剧，扮演\n翻译家这一点之前已经跟您说过了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ccd6dee66a8a62a0b8e84d303c4ba1a3620c6680c2c856476ffb05bd3a6282",
      "text": "舞台监督那边追加了委托，\n希望我把剧中用到的英文句子翻译出来，对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06f99c85e477fcdddb4887394b863edbab31778909ac9f56a5f340f45af5b3c8",
      "text": "是的！对方希望能使用带着翼先生感性翻译出的台词。\n这是相关的剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a640bfe7b09b6c420e942e75a5da1680cd429f0f4d76679ae3f9f3a52a620514",
      "text": "……原来如此，是悬疑剧啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84def67e766530b90ef1ae8e5aa17cfb222f848c8a596345131d016d6d127db6",
      "text": "您觉得如何？如果觉得有困难的话\n也可以回绝……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1433b3b72f8f30d8681f4aa1ed2d20bdaaa5d59f178c5fd4548637f664d21e49",
      "text": "……不用，这种程度的英译完全没问题！\n译好之后我会发给您的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eab2396fd042259357bc04b7c6b4b5b0eaa12ae744a0d87f4f3a8522c859e132",
      "text": "那就拜托您了。如果有什么问题，\n随时都可以跟我商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a40e7f54b7a8f9e1ce205fcff5c75e722808dd86345ea7446aa97e366020a66a",
      "text": "拜托了。\n然后，关于今后的日程安排……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000035:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16216436c5b82da4dd0de41754414e2d7a9993afd63ae3cac590ed427f10856e",
      "text": "一小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a1559717a75eb3fa0d3d8701abd5e5fb1b7239b81e0abe6b5422290dffe117",
      "text": "今天的碰头会就到这里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:087c12676d59ee8325d2a957467d3f546a0a5cd5e840e8d439a239e5e33f440a",
      "text": "辛苦了！\n唔……啊，已经这个时间了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2ef0fd9af3744d5f2e1d60c2b73646adb724e541c47701b4fa1bc1df4440933",
      "text": "哥哥，肚子饿了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ebcca4dd8b52e86dec3bb751737077db1b7e6728b8fc1716409a5f4a626b297",
      "text": "乖乖，吃点点心吧……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6577a9caf2e839b8eac9d0719827c9f1bdfe2546ede68e5947d627921d57513",
      "text": "（肚子发出了好大一声咕噜声……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:259714cc2383fc0f4c5ef2f34b1d708574ff7554f8ba29819b527253c4414bb5",
      "text": "啊哈哈……对不起。\n我也肚子饿了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3a3f0c23fc4ad4c0544d60f19936d5bd76042ac09ff9cb2452ddd3982114b16",
      "text": "不介意的话制作人也一起吃点\n点心好吗？有很好吃的饼干哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:848f9a3c4e7a4c217cd03601d81c620ae27221ec9d513dfb1d70149865704cd8",
      "text": "让您久等了！\n请吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d56ce28a1f85d968e574de0399e059e2143b1abc065cc0e18b2d6a3a08851c7",
      "text": "（刚才明明还是一副非常认真的表情，\n现在眼睛却闪闪发光地盯着饼干）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:213a13881cecae7164af64d6c67b9a41a0befa5d03fb55567494c25430ec3efc",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n那我就不客气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:928b92780a66ee71be04ff8bab928a5aa10960acd7fa6bfb1ef9a37375576040",
      "text": "我也开动了。\n……真好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45252fcacb3df25eddef16d8522d1c976868ac80b92fcaf64912ebefbe099782",
      "text": "（翼先生吃东西的样子看起来真香啊。\n看着这张笑脸，就想起了初次相遇的那天）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c4aeae17119c3a7075ac297aa873a7a38e02f8711393e0a4e2387a0be51deee",
      "text": "（那时候，我也是被翼先生津津有味\n吃东西的样子所吸引的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c0f6b8a0092e687ada7e82faf1758497bba58a44c71575897fc8722aec5c601",
      "text": "嚼嚼……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d26150155163b4eec203c5215a5d9c699efde36a6b57fd811909f47a5d1f536",
      "text": "怎么了吗，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我脸上沾了什么东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c15b0820d844e8284486828a4502a8be8c97df4fda801fac847d54d4e42cc9e8",
      "text": "不，没什么。\n这个饼干真的很好吃呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:724a514abdc00ba706ea201d92ef8992adbd233db9dd4f5be1e2d3c30c918bc7",
      "text": "对吧！制作人也\n喜欢真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bbb086a3c3f4d260df5e7b9bbc6f4f2facec6acc4799ce144a6d21bbaf49daa",
      "text": "还有好多呢尽管吃吧。\n咖啡也可以续杯哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_006tsu_01_1_2_006_01:1_2_006_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:331d34592ba70dea0dcbe42f1442c7455ca7618b335aa002cfa9f85e25e37efe",
      "text": "这是今天的谢礼，请不要客气哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
